# Source and documentation keep LF in the repository and are checked out with
# whatever the platform wants.
*.c     text
*.cpp   text
*.h     text
*.hpp   text
*.inc   text
*.py    text
*.md    text
*.txt   text
*.ini   text
*.iss   text
*.rc    text
*.def   text
*.bat   text eol=crlf
CMakeLists.txt text

# Everything under bin/ is the 1998 product: engine binaries, language rule
# files, the compiled installer script and 27-year-old text files. None of it is
# ours to reformat, and a line-ending conversion applied to a rule file would
# leave a voice that loads and mispronounces. Last, so it wins over the rules
# above -- in .gitattributes the later match takes effect.
*.dll   binary
*.exe   binary
*.ivx   binary
bin/**  binary
